(text "DFFSN_J2N16X7 testbench (tools/kicad/gen_latch_j2n16.py, stimulus and .meas from tools/spice/latch_tb.py).\nSTIM_x (HV PWL, ideal) -> divider -> driver triode (Ra 10k + L 680u || 10k) -> divider -> x (LV DUT input): real edges and levels.\nEach output -> one divider (C1 3.9 pF per grid) -> x_LV -> load tubes, both grids on the net.\nAs DFF_J2N16_tb; SN (the reset line, idle -20 V) at GND from 8.2 to 11.7 us.\nThe plain-SPICE run of the same bench: python3 tools/spice/latch_tb.py" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 180.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "83310292-4427-41df-ae6a-406dd88ae4c4"))
